Input: {"question": "Which administrative body is twinned with Cádiz?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 115, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Alytus and Cádiz Celebrate 10 Years of Sister City Bond, Foster Cultural Exchange and Economic Growth"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 117, "end": 377, "text": "**ALYTUS, LITHUANIA - CÁDIZ, SPAIN** - This week, the cities of Alytus, Lithuania, and Cádiz, Spain, marked a decade of sister city relations, a partnership that has brought about significant cultural, educational, and economic benefits to both municipalities."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 378, "end": 524, "text": "In 2012, the two cities formalized their twinning agreement, aiming to promote mutual understanding, exchange ideas, and strengthen economic ties."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 525, "end": 638, "text": "Since then, the partnership has flourished, with numerous joint projects, cultural events, and exchange programs."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 639, "end": 857, "text": "\"Alytus and Cádiz may seem like an unlikely pair, but our shared values and commitment to innovation have created a strong bond between our cities,\" said Alytus Mayor, Vytautas Grigaravičius, in an exclusive interview."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 858, "end": 982, "text": "\"We've seen a significant increase in tourism, trade, and educational exchanges, which have greatly benefited our citizens.\""}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 983, "end": 1095, "text": "Cádiz Mayor, José María González Santos, echoed the sentiment, highlighting the importance of cultural exchange."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1096, "end": 1145, "text": "\"Our cities have learned so much from each other."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1146, "end": 1311, "text": "We've shared our rich histories, traditions, and artistic expressions, enriching the lives of our citizens and fostering a deeper understanding between our nations.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1312, "end": 1479, "text": "One of the most successful initiatives has been the annual \"Cádiz-Alytus Cultural Festival,\" which brings together artists, musicians, and performers from both cities."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1480, "end": 1629, "text": "The festival has become a staple in both cities' calendars, attracting thousands of visitors and generating significant revenue for local businesses."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1630, "end": 1840, "text": "According to data from the Alytus Chamber of Commerce, trade between the two cities has increased by 25% over the past five years, with a significant surge in exports of Lithuanian textiles and Spanish seafood."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1841, "end": 2048, "text": "The partnership has also led to the establishment of several joint educational programs, including a student exchange initiative between the University of Cádiz and the Alytus University of Applied Sciences."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2049, "end": 2184, "text": "To date, over 100 students have participated in the program, gaining valuable international experience and forging lasting connections."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2185, "end": 2327, "text": "As the two cities look to the future, they are exploring new areas of cooperation, including sustainable energy and environmental initiatives."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2328, "end": 2455, "text": "\"We're excited to continue our collaboration and tackle the challenges of the 21st century together,\" said Mayor Grigaravičius."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 72, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Brest and Cádiz: A Tale of Twin Cities Across the Atlantic"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 74, "end": 267, "text": "In a testament to the power of international cooperation and cultural exchange, the port city of Brest in Brittany, France, and the municipality of Cádiz in Spain have been twinned for decades."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 268, "end": 460, "text": "This special bond between the two cities has fostered a deep sense of friendship and mutual understanding, bridging the distance between the Atlantic coast of France and the Iberian Peninsula."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 461, "end": 679, "text": "According to the official website of the City of Brest, the twinning agreement between Brest and Cádiz was signed in 1986, with the aim of promoting economic, cultural, and educational exchanges between the two cities."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 680, "end": 786, "text": "Since then, numerous initiatives have been launched to strengthen the ties between the two municipalities."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 787, "end": 875, "text": "\"We are proud to have Cádiz as our twin city,\" said François Cuillandre, Mayor of Brest."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 876, "end": 989, "text": "\"Our partnership has enabled us to share best practices, exchange ideas, and learn from each other's experiences."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 990, "end": 1071, "text": "It's a perfect example of how cities can work together to build a better future.\""}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1072, "end": 1163, "text": "One of the most notable examples of this cooperation is in the field of maritime education."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1164, "end": 1360, "text": "The University of Western Brittany in Brest and the University of Cádiz have established a joint program in naval engineering, allowing students to benefit from the expertise of both institutions."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1361, "end": 1546, "text": "\"Cádiz and Brest share a rich maritime history, and our twinning agreement has enabled us to leverage this common heritage to develop innovative programs in naval engineering,\" said Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1547, "end": 1604, "text": "María Jesús Rodríguez, Rector of the University of Cádiz."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1605, "end": 1725, "text": "\"Our students have greatly benefited from this exchange, and we look forward to continuing this fruitful collaboration.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1726, "end": 1983, "text": "Data from the European Commission's Twinning Database reveals that Brest and Cádiz have received funding for several joint projects, including initiatives focused on sustainable urban development, cultural heritage preservation, and youth exchange programs."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1984, "end": 2209, "text": "In addition, the two cities have also collaborated on various cultural events, such as the Brest-Cádiz International Music Festival, which brings together musicians from both cities to celebrate their shared musical heritage."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2210, "end": 2368, "text": "As the Mayor of Cádiz, José María González, noted, \"Our twinning agreement with Brest has been a driving force behind our city's internationalization efforts."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2369, "end": 2532, "text": "We are committed to continuing this partnership, which has brought so many benefits to our citizens and has helped to strengthen the bonds between our two cities.\""}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Alytus", "Brest"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Alytus", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Brest", "origin": "initial"}]}
